			<div class="gallerytext">
			</div>
		</div></li>
		<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 155px"><div style="width: 155px">
			<div class="thumb" style="width: 150px;"><div style="margin:34.5px auto;"><a href="/wiki/File:1.69inch-Touch-LCD-7.jpg" class="image"><img alt="1.69inch-Touch-LCD-7.jpg" src="/w/upload/thumb/c/cc/1.69inch-Touch-LCD-7.jpg/120px-1.69inch-Touch-LCD-7.jpg" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="120" height="81" srcset="/w/upload/thumb/c/cc/1.69inch-Touch-LCD-7.jpg/180px-1.69inch-Touch-LCD-7.jpg 1.5x, /w/upload/thumb/c/cc/1.69inch-Touch-LCD-7.jpg/240px-1.69inch-Touch-LCD-7.jpg 2x" /></a></div></div>
			<div class="gallerytext">
			</div>
		</div></li>
</ul>
<ul><li>Copy the path down, open it with Explorer, and copy all the files in the libraries folder in the example to the libraries under that path, as shown below:</li></ul>
<p><a href="/wiki/File:1.69inch-Touch-LCD-8.jpg" class="image"><img alt="1.69inch-Touch-LCD-8.jpg" src="/w/upload/e/e8/1.69inch-Touch-LCD-8.jpg" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="600" height="273" /></a>
</p>
<ul><li>After completing the above operation, open the ino file in the 1.69inch_Touch_LCD_ESP32S3 folder, and the related configuration is as follows (Here <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://www.waveshare.com/esp32-s3-dev-kit-n8r8.htm">ESP32-S3-DEV-KIT-N8R8</a> is used):<br /></li></ul>
<p><a href="/wiki/File:1.69inch-Touch-LCD-9.jpg" class="image"><img alt="1.69inch-Touch-LCD-9.jpg" src="/w/upload/9/9e/1.69inch-Touch-LCD-9.jpg" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="800" height="795" /></a><br />
</p>
